  "rules": {
    "objective": "Each player starts with a score of 20; the object is to be the first to reach zero.",
    "gameplay": "Forehand chooses trump (from first 2 cards). Exchange up to 3. May drop out (not trump chooser). Follow suit, must trump if void. 1 trick = -1pt. All 5 = -5pts. 0 tricks while in = +5pts. Hearts = double. Diamonds = must stay.",
